{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_08_263612873#3_505308024","relevance":3,"reason":"The document section is directly about Africa and the Atlantic slave trade and explicitly states that West African rulers were instrumental: they exchanged prisoners of war for British firearms, then used those weapons to expand territories, increasing political tension and violence.","learned":"West African kings and chiefs contributed by trading war captives for European firearms, using the weapons to expand power and intensify warfare that fed the slave trade."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3437","reason":"This query produced a highly direct grade-3 source about rulers exchanging captives for guns; continue the result list for more non-duplicate evidence on rulers, goods, and European exchange."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3437"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_27_5134399#3_8165976","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3437","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_27_5134399#3_8165976\" , \"end_char\": 4074.000000 , \"headings\": \" \" , \"segment\": \"African slaves contributed greatly to the economic and cultural development of the Americas. Their greatest contribution was their labor. Africans brought their expertise, especially in agriculture. They also brought their culture. Their art, music, religion, and food continue to influence American societies. Why did many African rulers participate in the Atlantic slave trade? Lured by profits <cover>African rulers delivered slaves to the Europeans in exchange for gold, guns, </cover>and other goods. THIS SET IS OFTEN IN FOLDERS WITH... Chapter 20 - The Atlantic World - Section 1 - Spai… 12 terms grumhausj Chapter 20 - The Atlantic World - Section 2 - Euro… 12 terms rmal Chapter 20.4 - The Atlantic World - Section 4 - Th… 8 terms grumhausj Chapter 20 - The Atlantic World - Section 2 - Euro… 13 terms grumhausj YOU MIGHT ALSO LIKE... Chapter 20.3 - The Atlantic World - Section 3 - Th… 13 terms ballen60 Chapter 4 section 3 honors world history: The Atla… 18 terms cstechow01 World History Chapter 20 Section 3 18 terms Destiny667 Atlantic Slave "}}
